			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741530801,
					"content": "灰河这一带的味道不太好闻，不像「上面」，连空气里都有一股香水味。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530802,
					"content": "怎么样？在灰河逛得开心吗？相信你们跟史诺德格拉斯聊得很愉快。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530803,
					"content": "你、你跟踪我们？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530804,
					"content": "什么时候？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530805
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530805,
					"content": "我没有闲心思跟多管闲事的孩子斗嘴。唉，就算让你们回家找父母去，你们应该也不会听。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530806,
					"content": "听我说，有时候眼睛看到的和耳朵听到的未必就是真的、对的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530807,
					"content": "别人家的事情，你还没弄明白之前不要总想着乱掺和。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530808,
					"content": "对了，皮普说这段时间我家里订的报纸都在你们手上，请还给我们吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530809,
					"content": "你不得不将报纸交还给了阿托斯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530810,
					"content": "他冷冷地看了你们一眼，转身离去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530811
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530811,
					"content": "这个家伙给我的感觉好不舒服…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530812,
						741530813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530812,
					"content": "我有同感。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530814
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530814,
					"content": "啊，好讨厌，虽然发现了点什么，但完全串不起来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530815,
					"content": "而且…而且我感觉有点混乱，伯努瓦是正受到威胁的好人，我们应该帮助他，是这样没错吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530816,
						741530817,
						741530818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530816,
					"content": "谨慎观察。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530819,
					"content": "是吗？这样就可以了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530820,
					"content": "这几天总是有推翻我想法的事情发生，脑子根本不够用。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530821,
					"content": "但是你真的好冷静，一点都不慌张。我是不是其实有点笨，你不会嫌弃我吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530822,
						741530824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530822,
					"content": "不会嫌弃派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530823
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530823,
					"content": "#嗯，我就知道，你最好了。{NICKNAME}是天底下最最最可靠的人，幸好有你！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530826,
					"content": "这么一想，说不定我其实相当聪明，只是一时没有理解状况而已。哼哼，一定是这样！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530827,
					"content": "让聪明的派蒙来想想下一步该怎么办…嗯，我们是不是那个…打草惊蛇了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530828,
					"content": "这样的话，我们就应该过一阵子再来看看伯努瓦家有没有什么新情况，对吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530829,
					"content": "只能这样了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530830
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530830,
					"content": "好，我们过一阵子再来吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530824,
					"content": "派蒙不笨。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530825
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530825,
					"content": "真的吗？连你都这么说，我肯定就是不笨。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530817,
					"content": "小心行动。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530818,
					"content": "先不要急着下判断。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530813,
					"content": "他们在计划着什么…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530814
					]
				}
			]
